 ### 10\. Limitations

 Possible limitations can include:

 - AI-generated content may occasionally contain inconsistencies.
- Character appearance may vary between generated panels.
- Image generation can require significant processing time.
- Output quality depends on prompt quality and model capabilities.
- API availability and usage limits can affect the application.
- AI-generated content may require human review and editing.

