- Personalized character libraries.
- Improved story continuity using advanced AI workflows.

 ### 12\. Conclusion

 The documentation concludes the development lifecycle by presenting the design, implementation, testing, and results of **ComicCraft-AI**. Proper documentation makes the project easier to understand, maintain, demonstrate, evaluate, and further develop. It also provides a complete reference for future developers who want to extend the AI-based comic generation system.
